            </span>

        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="intro-content">

        <span class="section-label">
            WHO WE ARE
        </span>

        <h2>
            Making a Difference
            Where It Matters Most
        </h2>

        <p>
            Gift of the Givers is a humanitarian organisation
            that responds to people affected by disasters,
            hunger and difficult situations.
        </p>

        <p>
            Since its establishment in 1992, the organisation
            has provided humanitarian assistance in South
            Africa and around the world.
        </p>

        <p>
            The goal is simple: help people, restore dignity
            and give hope when it is needed most.
        </p>

        <div class="quote-box">

            <i class="bi bi-quote"></i>

            <p>
                Best among people are those who
                benefit mankind.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

